Chapter: BrotliRfcConformance
  cites Compress chapter Brotli

 GENERATED by build/brotli-conformance.ps1 -Emit. Do not edit by hand.

 One stream per section of RFC 7932, written by hand from the RFC rather than by
 any encoder. Every expected line is what .NET's BrotliStream decodes the stream
 to; a len=0 line is a stream the RFC calls invalid, which .NET refuses.

